// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Arachnos Warzone Liaison 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2103287166" "Arachnos Warzone Liaison"
// ProfessionString :
"P1813963948" "Arachnos Warzone Liaison"
// DescriptionString :
"P304994505" "Warzone Liaisons have the unenviable job of trying to funnel Arachnos-friendly traffic into Warzones. It's no easy task, especially when the Warzone in question is on the outskirts of Paragon City. Villains going in there know they may be blown to bits; as a result, being a Warzone Liaison is a fulltime job."
// HelloString :
"P4127643763" "This should never appear"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3994374816" "If you're looking for opportunities for advancement, you couldn't do better than Siren's Call. It's a Warzone, which means you not only get to work your way up in Arachnos' estimation; you get to pound on heroes, too. Siren's Call is on the outskirts of Paragon City, and it's going to be Arachnos' first beachhead there... as soon as we get rid of those Longbow wimps. Meet up with Operative Massey to get an assignment, or speak to the Arbiter in the base learn about bounties. <br><br><color red> <color red>Siren's Call is a heroes versus villains PVP area. Do not enter if you are not willing to face player heroes who are trying to defeat you.</color> "
// LocationString :
"P607884113" "Sharkhead Isle"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Generated by transModule
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : SC_Longbow_Warzone_Liason 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Longbow Warzone Liaison 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1763500634" "Longbow Warzone Liaison"
// ProfessionString :
"P3874727503" "Longbow Warzone Liaison"
// DescriptionString :
"P3565438573" "It is the Warzone Liaison's job to funnel heroes into Siren's Call to hold off the Arachnos invasion. She takes her job seriously; after all, if Arachnos establishes a beachhead in Paragon City, they won't stop there."
// HelloString :
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P272765454" "I'm looking for heroes to head into Siren's Call. It's a Warzone, which means you'll probably wind up in combat with villains. But it's important that every able hero makes his presence felt there. We have to stave off Arachnos' invasion! Talk to Agent Brinson to get an assignment, or look up the Security Chief to learn about bounties.<color red>Siren's Call is a heroes versus villains PVP area. Do not enter if you are not willing to face player villains who are trying to defeat you.</color>"
// LocationString :
"P3493519327" "Steel Canyon"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


