// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Warzone Agent Brinson 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1481850597" "Warzone Agent Brinson"
// ProfessionString :
"P4236901306" "War Zone Agent"
// DescriptionString :
"P2099213153" "Agent Brinson has a hard job on his shoulders. Tasked with repelling Arachnos from Siren's Call, he needs all the help he can get. He's always looking for new heroes to respond to this threat, and he gives them all the support he can offer."
// HelloString :
"P3065100434" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I hope you're ready for action.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P165461357" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Let's do some good.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1213563317" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>We've got to fight back against Arachnos.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2307874018" "You need an introduction to deal with me, {HeroName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1255872819" "If you're ready to take on a real challenge, you can be a big help to Longbow here in Siren's Call. We have to push Arachnos out. <color red>Siren's Call is a PVP area. Do not accept my tasks if you are not willing to face villains who are trying to kill you.</color>"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P897299474" "I've got nothing more for you, {HeroName}."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2224109232" "You can't be much help here if you're already overworked."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1317581692" "I have something, but it's classified beyond your current Security Level."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1738971563" "You're doing well, {heroName}, very well. I'm proud to be working with you."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P545063475" "You're a remarkable asset to Longbow, {HeroName}. Please keep coming back for more work."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2615211467" "I'm afraid there's nothing here worthy of your talents."
// LocationString :
"P295237535" "Siren's Call"
// IntroString :
"P278615706" "You should talk to War Zone Agent Brinson over in Siren's Call. The man could really use some help keeping that zone free of Arachnos."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2601337924" "Choose Agent Brinson"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P130507818" "Brinson's a good guy in an impossible position. Do whatever you can to help him out."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2520881952" "There's <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</a> I'd like you to meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3115376823" "There are a couple of <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</a> I'd like you to meet."
// PVPPatrol :
"P3091046860" "Patrol Siren's Call"
// PVPMission1 :
"P2950633201" "Defuse bombs to debuff villain damage"
// PVPMission2 :
"P948871786" "Rescue officer to debuff villain resistance"
// PVPMission3 :
"P1148683731" "Defend supply depot to buff hero damage"
// PVPMission4 :
"P3149018681" "Recover technology to buff hero resistance"
