"P2203252842" "Warzone Operative Massey"
// ProfessionString :
"P4256580217" "War Zone Operative"
// DescriptionString :
"P2398871666" "Operative Massey"
// HelloString :
"P3930120508" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Are you ready to prove yourself to Arachnos?</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1630776696" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I've got a job for you.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P3546226107" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Let's get to work.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1207456947" "We haven't met, kid. So beat it."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2999780388" "If you're ready to hang with the big boys, maybe you can help us win this war in Siren's Call. You do that, Arachnos'll be grateful. <color red>Siren's Call is a PVP area. Do not accept my tasks if you are not willing to face heroes who are trying to kill you.</color>"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3378404167" "I've got nothing for you. Go see one of your other contacts."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1233049561" "You're too busy to be any good to me."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P14242613" "I've got something, but you're not getting your hands on it until you reach Threat Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2882133831" "You're doing good work, I have to admit it. You're an asset here in Siren's Call."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2238582546" "I'm impressed by you, {VillainName}. I hope you keep coming back for more work."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2991705212" "We've got nothing more to say to each other. Move along."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3501073124" "You should go talk to War Zone Operative Massey, over in Siren's Call. He can use all the help he can get in taking that zone."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3640486038" "Choose Operative Massey"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1983562149" "Operative Massey is a hard case, but he won't be reluctant to mention your work to Arachnos."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2283976122" "There's <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</a> you should meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P757159851" "There are some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</a> you should meet."
// PVPPatrol :
